#created by Duel Circuit - No Limits: Tenpai Dragon, summer 2024 (Sasha "Sangen")
#title Tenpai Dragon (2024, uncut)
#era 2024
#tier No Limits peak build: pool (docs/dev/NO-LIMITS-SPEC-2026-11-02.md section 5)
#about Won the 2024 European WCQ, the summer it was the second-most played deck in the biggest rooms. It goes second on purpose: Raigeki, Dark Hole and Lightning Storm clear the board, then the Tenpai Dragons Synchro Summon in the Battle Phase for one-turn wins. Here with Giant Trunade bouncing the backrow first and two FIRE Dragon Rulers in the grave.
#why Peak list: July 2024; restored: Sangen Summoning x3, Tenpai Dragon Chundra x3, Sangen Kaimen x3; picks: Giant Trunade, Raigeki (the power card, already at 3 in the list), Blaster, Dragon Ruler of Infernos, Burner, Dragon Ruler of Sparks; cuts: Dimension Shifter x3 (it banishes the Dragon Rulers' and Fadra's revives). Measured 2026-11-03: rated 1675 (+0 over tenpai-dragon 1675).
#banlist TCG April 2024
#recipe tenpai-dragon
